  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6d3a720f-51a5-4e5f-9bad-a905212a0882.png\"></p>\n<h2><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 关于 Faz 的扮演服装</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>FazBrick Studios 团队呈现《Faz 的扮演服装》。本模组已维护并更新至现代版本的 Minecraft，完全兼容多人游戏。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>本项目专注于为玩家添加各种类型的服装、戏服和配饰，且完全不会干扰原版游戏的特性。该模组包含丰富多样的配饰，用于自定义和改善玩家在游戏内的外观。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>装扮成警察、消防员、法官、建筑工人、水管工、国王……可能性无穷无尽！</strong></p>\n<p><strong>该模组目前处于早期开发阶段，并将不断添加新内容并推进版本更新。</strong></p>\n<h2><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 我可以将其放入模组包中吗？</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>当然可以！请随意将此模组添加到您的模组包中。我们鼓励您这样做，只是别忘了注明出处。</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;模组内容</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>Faz 的扮演服装目前为游戏添加了种类繁多的服装和配饰。最新版本中已添加以下内容：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>法官服装</li>\n<li>警察制服</li>\n<li>消防员服装</li>\n<li>建筑工人服装</li>\n<li>胖水管工角色扮演</li>\n<li>厨师服装</li>\n<li>不同类型的鞋子</li>\n<li>夹克</li>\n<li>不同类型的面部配饰</li>\n<li>防化服角色扮演</li>\n<li>连衣裙</li>\n<li>囚犯角色扮演</li>\n<li>角色扮演道具&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1250026/description_40d4b20e-04cb-4f37-8f3f-9ee7e2dd4b0f.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1a32700b-b6c8-451f-a56f-d1c81add6d5f.png\"></p>\n<h2><strong>同时也试试官方的《核战之后》模组包吧！</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/after-the-nukes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1104729/description_947803e8-a182-4066-8184-9e5be075aed5.png\" width=\"509\" height=\"470\"></strong></a><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </strong><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;再分发许可协议</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>您不允许在 Curseforge 以外的网站或域名上上传或重新分发此模组。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>这特别包括 RU-Minecraft。</strong></p>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</li>\n</ul>",
